WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.334 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Let's get to some news here,
guys.

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:03.636
After firing
Attorney General Jeff Sessions,

00:00:03.636 --> 00:00:06.072 align:start size:94% position:6%
I read that President Trump
might replace him

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:07.474 size:75% position:38% line:92%
with Chris Christie.

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:09.175 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience oohs ]

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:10.076 size:88% position:44% line:92%
Christie was so excited,

00:00:10.076 --> 00:00:12.145 align:start size:94% position:6%
he tore his apron off
at Jersey Mike's

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:13.346 size:78% position:39% line:92%
and yelled, "I quit!"

00:00:13.346 --> 00:00:15.782 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:15.782 --> 00:00:17.283 line:92%
"I'm ready! Let's go! Enough!"

00:00:17.283 --> 00:00:18.018 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Applause continues ]

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:20.320 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right -- Trump
might replace Jeff Sessions

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:21.388 size:75% position:38% line:92%
with Chris Christie.

00:00:21.388 --> 00:00:22.188 line:92%
Apparently, Trump was like,

00:00:22.188 --> 00:00:24.391 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The elf didn't work --
let's try Santa."

00:00:24.391 --> 00:00:28.395 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:28.962 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Oh, get this.

00:00:28.962 --> 00:00:30.630 align:start size:94% position:6%
People here in New York
can't stop talking

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:31.931 line:92%
about a rare Mandarin duck

00:00:31.931 --> 00:00:33.867 align:start size:94% position:6%
that showed up in Central Park
a few days ago.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:35.869
You hear what I'm talking about?
Can we take a look at that duck?

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:37.737 align:start size:94% position:6%
Look at this. Oh, my.
[ Audience ohs ]

00:00:37.737 --> 00:00:38.605 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Ooh!
-Ow!

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.707 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That is --
That duck is beautiful.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Wow!

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.209 align:start size:94% position:6%
Uh, s-sorry, guys.
Just one second.

00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:45.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
I got to do something
real quick.

00:00:45.845 --> 00:00:47.247 size:75% position:38% line:92%
[ Slow music plays ]

00:00:47.247 --> 00:00:49.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
What up, duck?
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:51.117 align:start size:94% position:6%
Couldn't help but notice you
there in the pond.

00:00:51.117 --> 00:00:53.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
I just want to say
I like your style.

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:55.755 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
Yeah, I new you're new in town

00:00:55.755 --> 00:00:57.490 align:start size:94% position:6%
and probably haven't made
a lot of friends yet,

00:00:57.490 --> 00:01:01.728 align:start size:94% position:6%
so if you ever want to
just chill and do duck stuff,

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:02.829 align:start size:94% position:6%
give me a quack.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.829 --> 00:01:05.432 align:start size:94% position:6%
I could come up to the park
and sit on the bench

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:07.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
while you just
kind of float there.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:08.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
And maybe I could pick up
a loaf of bread

00:01:08.568 --> 00:01:12.372
and tear it into little pieces
and throw it at you to eat...

00:01:12.372 --> 00:01:13.840 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you're into
that sort of thing.

00:01:13.840 --> 00:01:14.607 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I-I...

00:01:14.607 --> 00:01:17.010
I can tell that you're not like
all the other ducks.

00:01:17.010 --> 00:01:17.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Light laughter ]
And...

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.880
you may have a mysterious past,
but you've got the look.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.548 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:24.017
So I know this is probably going
to come out all wrong,

00:01:24.017 --> 00:01:26.453 line:92%
but I just wanted to say...

00:01:26.453 --> 00:01:27.287 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Quack ]

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:30.123 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:32.459 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Applause continues ]

00:01:32.459 --> 00:01:34.260 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Whoo-hoo!

00:01:34.260 --> 00:01:34.928 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Guys, listen to this --

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:38.765
a woman in Australia just
gave birth to a 12-pound baby...

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:40.100 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Audience murmuring ]

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.468 line:92%
...without any pain meds.

00:01:41.468 --> 00:01:42.502 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:42.502 --> 00:01:44.804 align:start size:94% position:6%
Her doctor said,
"You were amazing,"

00:01:44.804 --> 00:01:45.672 size:88% position:44% line:92%
while the baby was like,

00:01:45.672 --> 00:01:46.773 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I am never gonna hear
the end of this."

00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:48.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter and applause ]
"This is -- I mean,

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:51.778 size:81% position:41%
This is my story now."
[ Applause continues ]

00:01:51.778 --> 00:01:53.980 align:start size:94% position:6%
Guys, I'm getting an update
from an earlier story.

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:55.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm not sure
if you've heard this,

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:58.384
but there's a rare Mandarin duck
in Central Park, and...

00:01:58.384 --> 00:01:59.219 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.219 --> 00:02:00.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
...it turns out the duck
has gone missing.

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Gasps ]
[ Audience ohhs ]

00:02:01.988 --> 00:02:04.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, my God, I'm sorry, guys.
One -- One sec.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:06.993 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Slow music plays ]
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.993 --> 00:02:08.061 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What up, duck?

00:02:08.061 --> 00:02:09.462 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:11.264 align:start size:94% position:6%
Classic you.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.264 --> 00:02:14.267
Even when you're on the run,
you got the whole city talking.

00:02:14.267 --> 00:02:15.001 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:15.969 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don't
have to explain yourself.

00:02:15.969 --> 00:02:18.605
You're wild,
and you were meant to fly free.

00:02:18.605 --> 00:02:20.073 line:92%
And I-I know it's getting cold,

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:21.574 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you're --
you're probably flying

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:22.375 line:92%
somewhere warmer right now,

00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:24.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
as I send this message through
the airwaves,

00:02:24.644 --> 00:02:26.813 line:92%
but...I'll never forget you.

00:02:26.813 --> 00:02:28.381 line:92%
And I hope you don't forget me.

00:02:28.381 --> 00:02:31.885
And, hey, no matter what this
crazy world throws your way,

00:02:31.885 --> 00:02:33.486 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
always remember...

00:02:33.486 --> 00:02:34.254 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Quack ]

00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:36.556 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:36.556 --> 00:02:40.360 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Applause continues ]

00:02:40.360 --> 00:02:41.060 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Hey, guys, I saw that

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The Grinch" is in theaters
this weekend.

00:02:43.229 --> 00:02:45.231 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm excited to have
"The Grinch."

00:02:45.231 --> 00:02:46.266 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:46.266 --> 00:02:48.835
And -- And get this -- they just
added an emotional new scene

00:02:48.835 --> 00:02:52.238
where Jeff Sessions reunites
with his family in Whoville.

00:02:52.238 --> 00:02:53.373 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Aw!
-Yeah, it's really good.

00:02:53.373 --> 00:02:54.474 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:54.474 --> 00:02:55.875 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Finally, you guys,

00:02:55.875 --> 00:02:57.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
it's time for
"Tonight Show News Blenders."

00:02:57.944 --> 00:02:59.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is
where we take real headlines

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:00.480 size:84% position:42% line:92%
and blend them together

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.682 align:start size:94% position:6%
to see how much weirder
we can make them.

00:03:02.682 --> 00:03:03.550 line:92%
I'll show you what I mean.

00:03:03.550 --> 00:03:04.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
For example,
if you blend the stories

00:03:04.717 --> 00:03:07.687
"Fans Upset After 'Dancing
with the Stars' Elimination,"

00:03:07.687 --> 00:03:11.257
"Trump Fires Jeff Sessions,
Quickly Shuffles Staff,"

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:14.294 align:start size:94% position:6%
and "Truffle Season
Doing Well"...

00:03:14.294 --> 00:03:14.694 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
you get,

00:03:14.694 --> 00:03:16.396 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Trump Quickly Eliminated
from 'Dancing with the Stars'

00:03:16.396 --> 00:03:18.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
After Doing
the Truffle Shuffle."

00:03:18.097 --> 00:03:19.232 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:19.232 --> 00:03:21.034 align:start size:94% position:6%
See?
-Yeah, I get it.

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:22.135 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Applause continues ]

00:03:22.135 --> 00:03:23.303 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Next up,
if you blend the stories

00:03:23.303 --> 00:03:27.707
"Under Armour Staff Uses Company
Credit Card at Strip Club"...

00:03:27.707 --> 00:03:28.274 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:28.274 --> 00:03:30.877 align:start size:94% position:6%
..."Ted Cruz Warns of Visit
from Illegal Aliens,"

00:03:30.877 --> 00:03:34.247 size:84% position:42%
and "Pop-up Shops Teach
Farm-to-table Cooking,"

00:03:34.247 --> 00:03:34.948 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
you get

00:03:34.948 --> 00:03:36.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Ted Cruz
Visits Alien Strip Club,

00:03:36.883 --> 00:03:37.951 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Pops Up Under Table."

00:03:37.951 --> 00:03:39.852 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:39.852 --> 00:03:42.155 size:81% position:41% line:92%
[ Applause continues ]

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:44.724
And here's the last one --
if you blend the stories

00:03:44.724 --> 00:03:47.393 line:92%
"Guys Mow 'FU45' into Lawn,"

00:03:47.393 --> 00:03:51.698
"Joe Biden Emerges From Voting
Booth, Goes Viral in Minutes,"

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:52.465 size:75% position:38% line:92%
and "Bill Gates Says

00:03:52.465 --> 00:03:54.734 align:start size:94% position:6%
Toilets Have Chilling Effect
on Environment,"

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:55.134 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
you get,

00:03:55.134 --> 00:03:57.437 align:start size:94% position:6%
"After 45 Minutes,
Joe Biden Emerges From Toilet,

00:03:57.437 --> 00:03:58.338 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Says, 'FU, Chili's.'"

00:03:58.338 --> 00:04:00.406
[ Laughter and applause ]
That's some wild stories.

00:04:00.406 --> 00:04:01.975 align:start size:94% position:6%
Guys,
we have a great show tonight.

00:04:01.975 --> 00:04:04.110 align:start size:94% position:6%
Give it up for The Roots!
-Let's go, man!

